    - target: {fileID: 8118185164639072151, guid: b7002d92ef7b313448647db35bf3d3c6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _additionalText
      value: 'I had to write the code down - it''s locked in the file cabinet. The
        key should be around here somewhere. If anyone finds this, stay alert. Marcus
        starting showing the same symptoms as Lisa from last week and we all know
        what happened to her. '
